        },
        {
          "text": "\" 'Noolwekyo mujjanga kwawulamu ensolo ennongoofu n'etali nnongoofu, n'ennyonyi ennongoofu n'etali nnongoofu. Temufuukanga abatali balongoofu olw'ensolo oba ennyonyi, oba ebiramu byonna ebitambula ku ttaka, bye mmaze okwawulako ne mbibategeeza nti si birongoofu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
